@startuml
title Baseline J01-J04: import -> search -> compare -> add to list -> restart and reload

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam DefaultFontColor #263238
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1565C0
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825
autonumber

actor "Household shopper" as Shopper
participant "Catalogue" as Catalogue
participant "Product" as Product
participant "Comparison" as Comparison
participant "ShoppingList" as ShoppingList
database "H2 file store" as Store

== J01 / J02 import ==

Shopper -> Catalogue : import (sample, then daily JSON)
activate Catalogue
Catalogue -> Catalogue : parse whole file\nmoney as BigDecimal
Catalogue -> Catalogue : validate: not empty,\nunique codes, three labels each
alt valid and not empty
  Catalogue -> Catalogue : replace(incoming)\nkeyed by product code
  Catalogue -> Store : save accepted catalogue\nimportedAt = now, sourceDate = null
  Catalogue --> Shopper : ImportResult(accepted = true)
else invalid or empty response
  Catalogue --> Shopper : ImportResult(accepted = false)\nlast accepted catalogue kept
end
deactivate Catalogue
note over Catalogue, Store
  A repeated import replaces the same
  product codes, so listings are not
  duplicated.
end note

== J03 search and compare ==

Shopper -> Catalogue : find(query, lang)
activate Catalogue
Catalogue --> Shopper : List<Product>\nstated pack via code
deactivate Catalogue

Shopper -> Product : compare()
activate Product
Product -> Comparison : create(product)
activate Comparison
loop every listing
  alt price is known
    Comparison -> Comparison : track cheapest, keep ties
  else price is null (unknown)
    Comparison -> Comparison : add retailer to missing
  end
end
Comparison --> Shopper : Comparison\ncheapest / ties / missing / importedAt
deactivate Comparison
deactivate Product
note over Comparison
  A null price is never treated as 0
  and can never win.
end note

== J04 add to list, then edit ==

Shopper -> ShoppingList : add(code, qty)
activate ShoppingList
alt qty >= 1
  ShoppingList -> Store : save shopping list
  ShoppingList --> Shopper : updated list
else qty invalid
  ShoppingList --> Shopper : clear input error\nlist unchanged
end
deactivate ShoppingList

Shopper -> ShoppingList : changeQuantity(code, qty)
activate ShoppingList
ShoppingList -> Store : save shopping list
ShoppingList --> Shopper : updated list
deactivate ShoppingList

Shopper -> ShoppingList : toggle(code, checked)
activate ShoppingList
ShoppingList -> Store : save checked state
ShoppingList --> Shopper : updated list
deactivate ShoppingList

== restart, then reload ==

Shopper -> Store : restart app, open saved data
Store --> Catalogue : accepted catalogue\n(importedAt, sourceDate)
Store --> ShoppingList : items\n(productCode, quantity, checked, addedAt)
Shopper -> Catalogue : find(query, lang)
Catalogue --> Shopper : same products as before restart
Shopper -> ShoppingList : view list
ShoppingList --> Shopper : same items, same quantities\nand checked state
@enduml
